Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: c25b70f756d83e31c92d74a4e3cca8a1d499d6cfb59ac15988896225b815f39b
Daylit anonymous countryside room prepared for a small retreat, one modest empty chair, a clean folded blanket and a second chair unobtrusively out of focus. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
